From 6e1c23610d4460958e3f893145c68ad112fe32d5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yash Katariya <yashkatariya@google.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Aug 2024 15:10:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] If input layouts are specified via `in_shardings` to `jit`
 and the array that the jitted function is called with is uncommitted, reshard
 the input array to the layout specified by the user.

Not doing the resharding, leads to incorrect outputs on GPU and a crash on TPU which is not good.

Fixes: https://github.com/google/jax/issues/23100
PiperOrigin-RevId: 665000157
